# Asset Organization Guide

## Screenshots & Images

All project screenshots should be organized in the `assets/images/` folder:

```
assets/
└── images/
    ├── dashboard-overview.png
    ├── revenue-analytics.png
    ├── customer-analytics.png
    └── executive-summary.png
```

### Screenshot Standards

✓ Screenshots taken in **Reading/Published View** (not Edit Mode)  
✓ High resolution (1920x1080 minimum)  
✓ Clear, professional presentation  
✓ Dashboard fully visible without clipping  
✓ Consistent lighting and contrast  

### Naming Convention

```
[dashboard-name]-[page-number].png

Example:
revenue-analytics-dashboard-1.png
customer-intelligence-dashboard-2.png
```

---

## README Image References

When referencing images in README files:

```markdown
![Revenue Analytics Dashboard](./assets/images/revenue-analytics-dashboard-1.png)
```

